d":7265601,"initDialog":726560101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[30064],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Jiguanqitan_72656/Q7265601","priority":5,"questId":72656,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":726560101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":462225418,"text":"Come, try your hand at Theater Mechanicus!","nextNodeIds":[726560102,726560106]},{"nodeId":726560102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2613208690,"text":"What is it?","nextNodeIds":[726560103]},{"nodeId":726560103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":3261347186,"text":"W—Welcome! I am a local representative for this new game from Liyue. It's called Theater Mechanicus!","nextNodeIds":[726560104]},{"nodeId":726560104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":141283698,"text":"In short, it is a game that can be played on a board. It was first invented by Ms. Ruijin from Liyue.","nextNodeIds":[726560105]},{"nodeId":726560105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":1858816842,"text":"Well, according to Ms. Ruijin, I am one of their overseas agents.","nextNodeIds":[726560111]},{"nodeId":726560111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":1583550786,"text":"After I obtained... umm... the distribution rights, Ms. Ruijin sent me a complete set of Theater Mechanicus and the business model that goes with it.","nextNodeIds":[726560112]},{"nodeId":726560112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":3354724306,"text":"Although it initially got confiscated by the Outlander Affairs Agency... It took me a while to get this copy of the game back.","nextNodeIds":[726560113]},{"nodeId":726560113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1453010738,"text":"Why did the Outlander Affairs Agency confiscate this...","nextNodeIds":[726560114]},{"nodeId":726560114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":3217229530,"text":"They'll confiscate anything from overseas...","nextNodeIds":[726560115]},{"nodeId":726560115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":1268162154,"text":"Anyway. Let's not talk about this.","nextNodeIds":[726560116]},{"nodeId":726560116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":1549314322,"text":"Do you see these things laid out on the table here? These are all important items used in Theater Mechanicus.","nextNodeIds":[726560117]},{"nodeId":726560117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":3871485714,"text":"Does it feel like Liyue? Hahaha, this version was tailor-made according to the descriptions in Ms. Ruijin's letter.","nextNodeIds":[726560118]},{"nodeId":726560118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":1660081858,"text":"I even had someone make this table... It cost me a fortune.","nextNodeIds":[726560119]},{"nodeId":726560119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":1963567394,"text":"And per Ms. Ruijin's suggestions, I added new features to Theater Mechanicus.","nextNodeIds":[726560120]},{"nodeId":726560120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapHash":2807020602,"text":"Well... Anyway, it's better to learn through practice. Why don't you just give it a go? You'll understand after you play it.","nextNodeIds":[726560121,726560123]},{"nodeId":726560121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1599256178,"text":"Play Theater Mechanicus.","nextNodeIds":[726560122]},{"nodeId":726560122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30064,"speakerName":"Komakata","textMapH